~ start
if QuestService.is_completed_offered()
	=> completed
elif QuestService.is_ready_offered()
	=> ready
elif QuestService.is_accepted_offered()
	=> in_progress
else
	Quartermaster: A scout is camping the north-east ridge. Drive it off.
	- I will handle the scout.
		do QuestService.request_accept_offered()
		Quartermaster: Stay off the slime pond. The ridge is enough.
		=> END
	- Not now.
		Quartermaster: The ridge can wait.
		=> END

~ in_progress
Quartermaster: The scout is still on the ridge.
=> END

~ ready
Quartermaster: That scout is down. I will close the errand.
- Turn in the scout report.
	do QuestService.request_turn_in_offered()
	=> END
- Keep hunting.
	=> END

~ completed
Quartermaster: The cert errand is done. Mail is still for sale.
=> END
